<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market 200 mln stg further help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market 200 mln stg further help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK money market with a further 200 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.  </p>
<p>			    EARLY	1200 GMT   1400 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.3 BLN    1.3 BLN    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY    100 MLN!   300 MLN!   =	    =</p>
<p>! INCLUDES 300 MLN STG REPO EXPIRING DEC 17 AT 5-31/32 PCT</p>
<p>(INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
</text>
